                "value": "PD NASA|Clouds and blue sky in Florida|Front views of vehicles|United States photographs taken on 2011-07-21|Featured pictures of Space Shuttles|Featured photographs in the public domain|Files from NASA with known IDs|Photographs by Kim Shiflett|Landing of STS-135",
